{"step_index":558,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-24T16:53:21Z","input_tokens":3757,"cache_read_tokens":73003,"output_tokens":1079,"thinking":"Planning the creation of Windows shortcuts using a scripting approach, specifying the target executable, command-line arguments, icon path, and description. The script will generate a shortcut named \"1. Sistema ERP Administrador.lnk\" pointing to the application executable and passing the `--main` argument, using the provided icon and description.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"$wsh = New-Object -ComObject WScript.Shell\n$targetDir = \"c:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\gym\\accesos directos\"\n$iconPath = \"c:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\gym\\LEGENDS\\build\\icon.ico\"\n$releaseDir = \"c:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\gym\\LEGENDS\\release\\FITNESS_LEGENDS_TERMINAL-win32-x64\"\n\n# 1. ERP Administrador\n$lnk1 = $wsh.CreateShortcut(\"$targetDir\\1. Sistema ERP Administrador.lnk\")\n$lnk1.TargetPath = \"$releaseDir\\FitnessLegends.exe\"\n$lnk1.Arguments = \"--main\"\n$lnk1.WorkingDirectory = $releaseDir\n$lnk1.IconLocation = \"$iconPath, 0\"\n$lnk1.Description = \"Fitness Legends - Sistema Central ERP Administrador\"\n$lnk1.Save()\n\n# 2. Terminal Torniquete\n$lnk2 = $wsh.CreateShortcut(\"$targetDir\\2. Terminal Torniquete de Acceso.lnk\")\n$lnk2.TargetPath = \"$releaseDir\\ControlDeAccesoLegends.exe\"\n$lnk2.Arguments = \"--terminal\"\n$lnk2.WorkingDirectory = $releaseDir\n$lnk2.IconLocation = \"$iconPath, 0\"\n$lnk2.Description = \"Fitness Legends - Terminal de Control de Acceso Torniquete\"\n$lnk2.Save()\n\n# 3. Cartera de Clientes\n$lnk3 = $wsh.CreateShortcut(\"$targetDir\\3. Cartera de Clientes & Socios.lnk\")\n$lnk3.TargetPath = \"$targetDir\\3. ACCESO_CARTERA_CLIENTES.bat\"\n$lnk3.WorkingDirectory = $targetDir\n$lnk3.IconLocation = \"$iconPath, 0\"\n$lnk3.Description = \"Fitness Legends - Cartera de Clientes y Membresias Pro\"\n$lnk3.Save()\n\n# 4. Vincular Equipos\n$lnk4 = $wsh.CreateShortcut(\"$targetDir\\4. Vincular Equipos en Red LAN.lnk\")\n$lnk4.TargetPath = \"$targetDir\\4. VINCULAR_EQUIPOS_RED_LAN.bat\"\n$lnk4.WorkingDirectory = $targetDir\n$lnk4.IconLocation = \"$iconPath, 0\"\n$lnk4.Description = \"Fitness Legends - Asistente de Conexion en Red LAN\"\n$lnk4.Save()\n\nWrite-Host \"Shortcuts created successfully.\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolSummary":"Create Windows shortcuts in accesos directos"}}]}
